  Schema recognition is not capability evidence; keep optional context management disabled.
continuation: unknown (no-continuation-round-trip)
  A stateless probe does not verify continuation, Fork, or restart; retain Harness-owned history.
nativeCompaction: rejected (no-native-compaction-integration)
  Keep Harness text-summary compaction; track the typed-operation and durable-replay prerequisites in Issue #65.
websocketReuse: rejected (request-owned-websockets)
  Model transport auto uses a fresh connection per request; this plugin does not expose cached WebSocket reuse.
